{"path":"locale/codecvt/encoding","title":"std::codecvt<InternT,ExternT,StateT>::encoding, do_encoding","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::codecvt&lt;InternT,ExternT,StateT&gt;::</span>encoding, do_encoding","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/codecvt/encoding","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"The exact number of externT characters that correspond to one internT character, if constant. 0 if the number varies, -1 if the encoding is state-dependent.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev t-dcl-rev-num\"><tr class=\"t-dcl-rev-aux\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"142\">(1)</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">public</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> encoding<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">throw</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">public</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> encoding<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev t-dcl-rev-num\"><tr class=\"t-dcl-rev-aux\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"142\">(2)</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> do_encoding<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">throw</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> do_encoding<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Public member function, calls the member function <code>do_encoding</code> of the most derived class.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> If the encoding represented by this codecvt facet maps each internal character to the same, constant number of external characters, returns that number. If the encoding is variable-length (e.g. UTF-8 or UTF-16), returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>. If the encoding is state-dependent, returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The exact number of <code>externT</code> characters that correspond to one <code>internT</code> character, if constant. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> if the number varies, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> if the encoding is state-dependent.\n</p><p>The non-converting specialization <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/codecvt\"><span class=\"kw1956\">std::<span class=\"me2\">codecvt</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">char</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbstate_t\"><span class=\"kw1187\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mbstate_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8 is a variable-length encoding, encoding() returns \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">use_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/codecvt\"><span class=\"kw1956\">std::<span class=\"me2\">codecvt</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">char</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbstate_t\"><span class=\"kw1187\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mbstate_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n                     <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                 <span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">encoding</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"zh_CN.gb18030 is also variable-length, encoding() == \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">use_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/codecvt\"><span class=\"kw1956\">std::<span class=\"me2\">codecvt</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">char</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbstate_t\"><span class=\"kw1187\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mbstate_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n                     <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"zh_CN.gb18030\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                 <span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">encoding</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"ru_RU.koi8r is a single-byte encoding, encoding() == \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">use_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/codecvt\"><span class=\"kw1956\">std::<span class=\"me2\">codecvt</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">char</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbstate_t\"><span class=\"kw1187\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mbstate_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n                     <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"ru_RU.koi8r\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                 <span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">encoding</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>en_US.utf8 is a variable-length encoding, encoding() returns 0\nzh_CN.gb18030 is also variable-length, encoding() == 0\nru_RU.koi8r is a single-byte encoding, encoding() == 1</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>MB_CUR_MAX</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> maximum number of bytes in a multibyte character in the current C locale<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(macro variable)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/codecvt/max_length\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_max_length</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the maximum number of <code>ExternT</code> characters that could be converted into a single <code>InternT</code> character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/codecvt","title":"std::codecvt"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::codecvt<InternT,ExternT,StateT>::encoding, do_encoding","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: until C++11, since C++11. Public member function, calls the member function do_encoding of the most derived class."},{"label":"Return value","note":"The exact number of externT characters that correspond to one internT character, if constant. 0 if the number varies, -1 if the encoding is state-dependent."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"MB_CUR_MAX","note":"maximum number of bytes in a multibyte character in the current C locale"},{"label":"do_max_length","note":"returns the maximum number of ExternT characters that could be converted into a single InternT character"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":248,"codeBlockCount":2}
